## Loading Priority Diagram

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    ConfigLoader Pipeline                  │
│                                                          │
│  ┌────────────┐   ┌─────────────┐   ┌───────────────┐   │
│  │  Compiled   │──▶│  File Parse │──▶│  Env Override  │   │
│  │  Defaults   │   │ (TOML/JSON) │   │  (APP_*)       │   │
│  └────────────┘   └─────────────┘   └───────┬───────┘   │
│                                              │           │
│                                     ┌────────▼────────┐  │
│                                     │   Validation    │  │
│                                     │  (aggregated)   │  │
│                                     └────────┬────────┘  │
│                                              │           │
│                                     ┌────────▼────────┐  │
│                                     │  Config (valid) │  │
│                                     └─────────────────┘  │
│                                                          │
│  Priority:  env vars > file values > compiled defaults   │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

## Key Design Decisions

| Decision | Rationale |
|---|---|
| **`deny_unknown_fields`** on all structs | Catches typos in config files at parse time |
| **`thiserror`** for error types | Structured errors with `Display` for logging and `source()` chains |
| **Aggregated validation** | Reports *all* problems at once instead of failing on the first one |
| **Builder pattern** (`ConfigLoader`) | Lets callers opt-in/out of env overrides and validation |
| **`ENV_PREFIX = "APP"`** | Namespaces env vars to avoid collisions (`APP_SERVER__PORT`) |
| **RAII `EnvGuard`** in tests | Prevents env-var mutations from leaking across tests |
| **`Mutex` for env tests** | Env vars are process-global; serializing avoids races under `cargo test` |
| **`PartialEq` on all types** | Enables simple equality assertions and round-trip tests |
| **`skip_validation()` gated by `cfg(test)`** | Available in tests only — production code always validates |

